    <span data-zh>向下探索</span><span data-en>scroll</span>
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ DESIGN DNA ═══ -->
<section class="section band-dark" id="dna">
  <div class="section-header dark">
    <h2><span data-zh>设计理念</span><span data-en>Design DNA</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>叠 · 织 · 照</span><span data-en>Stack · Weave · Illuminate</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="dna-grid">
    <div class="dna-card">
      <span class="big">叠</span>
      <h3>Stack</h3>
      <span class="roman">One heartbeat, eight mirrors</span>
      <p><span data-zh>同一心象在 8 语中叠加并置——一套语法，一面镜子。</span><span data-en>The same image of thought stacked across 8 languages — one grammar, one mirror each.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="dna-card">
      <span class="big">织</span>
      <h3>Weave</h3>
      <span class="roman">Languages annotate each other</span>
      <p><span data-zh>词源、直译、文化注疏缝合一体——三行对照，互为注释。</span><span data-en>Etymology, literal gloss, cultural notes woven together — three lines, mutual annotation.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="dna-card">
      <span class="big">照</span>
      <h3>Illuminate</h3>
      <span class="roman">Each language keeps its soul</span>
      <p><span data-zh>每语一个角色、一种音色、一种色彩、一种文明气韵。</span><span data-en>Every language has its role, timbre, palette, and the breath of a civilization.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="rules">
    <div class="rule"><span class="n">1</span><div><h5><span data-zh>源先于叙事</span><span data-en>Sources first</span></h5><p><span data-zh>引用必标出处，公版与原创优先；未经审校的译文绝不冒充权威。</span><span data-en>Cite primary sources; prefer public-domain and original texts; never pass unreviewed translations off as authoritative.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="rule"><span class="n">2</span><div><h5><span data-zh>一处语料</span><span data-en>One source of truth</span></h5><p><span data-zh>平行语料只存一份，视频 / 卡图 / 网页都从它渲染。</span><span data-en>Store each parallel text once; everything renders from it.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="rule"><span class="n">3</span><div><h5><span data-zh>绝不静默出错</span><span data-en>No silent errors</span></h5><p><span data-zh>天城体连字、日文竖排、拉丁长音符——每个字每个音都显式验证。</span><span data-en>Devanagari conjuncts, JP vertical, Latin macrons — every glyph and phoneme passes QA.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="rule"><span class="n">4</span><div><h5><span data-zh>宁少勿滥</span><span data-en>Slow is smooth</span></h5><p><span data-zh>先出 5 条试片跑通全链，再放量。</span><span data-en>Ship 5 pilots first, prove the chain, then scale.</span></p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ LANGUAGES ═══ -->
<section class="section" id="languages">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>语言 × 文明矩阵</span><span data-en>Language × Civilization Matrix</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>每种语言是一个文明的理由</span><span data-en>Behind every language stands the reason of a civilization</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="lang-grid">

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#8A2E3B; --lsbg:rgba(138,46,59,0.06);">
      <span class="glyph">中文</span>
      <span class="name">中文 Chinese <span class="iso">zh · 汉藏语系 Hanzi</span></span>
      <div class="family">表意方块字 · 意合 · 留白即意义</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>天人合一 · 礼乐 · 诗教 · 和而不同</span><span data-en>Unity of Heaven and Man · rites &amp; music · the teaching of poetry · harmony in diversity</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>诗眼与原乡</span><span data-en>The Poetic Source</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>墨·朱</span><span data-en>ink · cinnabar</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>古琴</span><span data-en>guqin</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">«上善若水 » · «海上生明月 »</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#24456F; --lsbg:rgba(36,69,111,0.06);">
      <span class="glyph lu">English</span>
      <span class="name">English <span class="iso">en · Indo-European Germanic</span></span>
      <div class="family">罗马字母 · 时态精严 · 双声部词汇</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>经验主义 · 契约 · 个体 · 言论自由</span><span data-en>Empiricism · contract · individualism · free speech</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>精确的音叉</span><span data-en>The Tuning Fork</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>藏青</span><span data-en>navy</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>民谣钢琴</span><span data-en>folk piano</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">"The woods are lovely, dark and deep."</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#7A5BA8; --lsbg:rgba(122,91,168,0.07);">
      <span class="glyph lu">Français</span>
      <span class="name">Français <span class="iso">fr · Romance</span></span>
      <div class="family">拉丁字母 + é è à ç œ · 联诵 · 性别与变位</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>启蒙 · 理性 · 雄辩 · esprit</span><span data-en>Enlightenment · reason · eloquence · l'esprit</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>哲思的低语</span><span data-en>Philosophy's Whisper</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>薰衣草·金</span><span data-en>lavender · gold</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>chanson</span><span data-en>chanson</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">« Le cœur a ses raisons que la raison ne connaît point. »</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#D4889C; --lsbg:rgba(212,136,156,0.08);">
      <span class="glyph ly2">日本語</span>
      <span class="name">日本語 Japanese <span class="iso">ja · Japonic</span></span>
      <div class="family">汉字 + 假名 · 竖排 · 助词框定 · 以心传心</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>物哀 · 幽玄 · 侘寂 · 一期一会</span><span data-en>mono no aware · yūgen · wabi-sabi · ichigo-ichie</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>留白的一瞬</span><span data-en>The Held Breath</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>和纸·樱</span><span data-en>washi · sakura</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>尺八·筝</span><span data-en>shakuhachi · koto</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">「古池や 蛙飛びこむ 水の音」</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#C77B22; --lsbg:rgba(199,123,34,0.08);">
      <span class="glyph lsa">संस्कृतम्</span>
      <span class="name">Sanskrit <span class="iso">sa · Indo-Aryan Devanagari</span></span>
      <div class="family">天城体 · sandhi · 复合词 · 语法近于数学</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>圣言 · 业与法 · 梵我一如 · 内观</span><span data-en>sacred utterance · karma &amp; dharma · ātman = brahman · inner science</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>根与咒</span><span data-en>The Root &amp; Mantra</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>姜黄·朱砂</span><span data-en>turmeric · cinnabar</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>维纳·颂钵</span><span data-en>vīṇā · bowls</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">ॐ शान्तिः शान्तिः शान्तिः</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#6E6154; --lsbg:rgba(110,97,84,0.07);">
      <span class="glyph lu">Latina</span>
      <span class="name">Latina Latin <span class="iso">la · Italic (macrons: ā ē ī ō ū)</span></span>
      <div class="family">屈折完备 · 词序自由 · 格言密度极高</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>罗马法 · 修辞 · 斯多葛 · 永续</span><span data-en>Roman law · oratory · Stoic calm · permanence</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>不朽的铭刻</span><span data-en>The Eternal Inscription</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>石白·暗铜</span><span data-en>limestone · bronze</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>管风琴</span><span data-en>organ</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">Carpe diem, quam minimum credula postero.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#4E6379; --lsbg:rgba(78,99,121,0.07);">
      <span class="glyph lu">Deutsch</span>
      <span class="name">Deutsch German <span class="iso">de · Germanic (ä ö ü ß)</span></span>
      <div class="family">复合词扣件机 · 动词框定 · 名词性极强</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>观念论 · 秩序 · 修养 · 森林</span><span data-en>Idealism · order · Bildung · the forest</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>思想的拱顶</span><span data-en>The Vault of Thought</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>板岩灰·钢蓝</span><span data-en>slate · steel</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>Lied 艺术歌曲</span><span data-en>Lied</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">»Wo aber Gefahr ist, wächst das Rettende auch.«</div>
    </div>

    <div class="lang-card" style="--lsc:#3E8FB0; --lsbg:rgba(62,143,176,0.07);">
      <span class="glyph lu">Svenska</span>
      <span class="name">Svenska Swedish <span class="iso">sv · North Germanic (å ä ö)</span></span>
      <div class="family">北欧澄澈 · 浮音旋律 · lagom · fika</div>
      <div class="dna"><span class="label">文明核心味 CIVILIZATIONAL SOUL</span><span data-zh>北欧自然 · 适度 · 高信任 · 光明与暗夜</span><span data-en>Nordic nature · lagom · high trust · light &amp; darkness</span></div>
      <div class="kw"><span data-both><span data-zh>北境的澄澈</span><span data-en>Northern Clarity</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>湖蓝·桦木</span><span data-en>lake blue · birch</span></span><span data-both><span data-zh>民谣·管风琴</span><span data-en>folk · organ</span></span></div>
      <div class="role">»Ja, visst gör det ont när knoppar brister.«</div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:1.6rem; font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft); text-align:center;" data-both>
    <span data-zh>每张卡 = 文明核心味（魂）→ 语言特色（表情）→ 制作要点（皮相）。新增 24 语身份卡见下节。</span>
    <span data-en>Each card = civilizational soul → linguistic character → production notes. The 24 new identity cards follow.</span>
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ═══ EXPANSION ROSTER ═══ -->
<section class="section band-soft" id="expansion">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>文明代表语种</span><span data-en>Civilizations, Represented</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>核心八语全量产出 · 新增 24 语 = 六大洲 × 12 语系 × 26 文字形态</span><span data-en>The core eight run full; 24 more join across 6 continents, 12 families, 26 scripts</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="exp-groups">

    <div class="exp-card">
      <div class="exp-head"><span class="exp-name">中华 · 汉字圈</span><span class="exp-en">Sinosphere</span></div>
      <div class="exp-chips">
        <span class="chip"><b>中文</b><i>zh · 汉字</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>日本語</b><i>ja · 汉字+假名</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>한국어</b><i>ko · 谚文</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>Tiếng Việt</b><i>vi · 国语字</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>བོད་ཡིག</b><i>bo · 藏文</i><em class="b">B</em></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-card">
      <div class="exp-head"><span class="exp-name">印度 · 双系统</span><span class="exp-en">India — two systems</span></div>
      <div class="exp-chips">
        <span class="chip"><b>संस्कृतम्</b><i>sa · 天城体</i><em class="b">B</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>हिन्दी</b><i>hi · 天城体</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>தமிழ்</b><i>ta · 泰米尔字母</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-card">
      <div class="exp-head"><span class="exp-name">波斯 · 伊斯兰</span><span class="exp-en">Persian-Islamic</span></div>
      <div class="exp-chips">
        <span class="chip"><b>العربية</b><i>ar · 阿拉伯字母</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>עברית</b><i>he · 希伯来字母</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>فارسی</b><i>fa · 波斯字母</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
        <span class="chip"><b>Türkçe</b><i>tr · 拉丁(1928)</i><em class="a">A</em></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exp-card">
      <div class="exp-head"><span class="exp-name">希腊罗马 · 拜占庭</span><span class="exp-en">Greco-Roman · Byzantine</span></div>
