          <td class="kana-cell void"><span>—</span></td>
          <td class="kana-cell particle"><span class="k">ヲ</span><span class="h">を</span><span class="r">o</span></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="derived">
    <span><em class="dl">DAKUON</em>が ぎ ぐ げ ご ・ ざ じ ず ぜ ぞ ・ だ ぢ づ で ど ・ ば び ぶ べ ぼ</span>
    <span><em class="dl">HANDAKUON</em>ぱ ぴ ぷ ぺ ぽ</span>
    <span><em class="dl">YŌON</em>きゃ きゅ きょ ・ しゃ しゅ しょ ・ ちゃ ちゅ ちょ ・ にゃ にゅ にょ ・ ひゃ ひゅ ひょ ・ みゃ みゅ みょ ・ りゃ りゅ りょ</span>
    <span><em class="dl">CHŌON · SOKUON · HATSUON</em>おかあさん ā ・ いって tt ・ しんぶん n̄</span>
  </div>

  <div class="gloss-wrap">
    <table class="gloss-table kana-word">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>仮名 Kana</th><th>言葉 Word</th><th>意味 Meaning</th><th>例句 Example</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">あ</span><span class="kana-kat">ア</span><span class="rom">a</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">雨 <span class="furigana">あめ</span></b><br><span class="rom">ame</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>雨</span><span data-en>rain</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">あめが、ふっています。</div><div class="rom">Ame ga, futte imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>正在下雨。</span><span data-en>It's raining.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">い</span><span class="kana-kat">イ</span><span class="rom">i</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">命 <span class="furigana">いのち</span></b><br><span class="rom">inochi</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>生命</span><span data-en>life</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">いのちは、いちどきりです。</div><div class="rom">Inochi wa, ichido kiri desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>生命只有一次。</span><span data-en>Life comes but once.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">う</span><span class="kana-kat">ウ</span><span class="rom">u</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">歌 <span class="furigana">うた</span></b><br><span class="rom">uta</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>歌</span><span data-en>song</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">みんなで、うたをうたいましょう。</div><div class="rom">Minna de, uta o utaimashō.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>大家一起唱歌吧。</span><span data-en>Let's all sing.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">え</span><span class="kana-kat">エ</span><span class="rom">e</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">絵 <span class="furigana">え</span></b><br><span class="rom">e</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>图画</span><span data-en>picture</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">このえは、だれがかきましたか。</div><div class="rom">Kono e wa, dare ga kakimashita ka.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>这幅画是谁画的？</span><span data-en>Who painted this picture?</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">お</span><span class="kana-kat">オ</span><span class="rom">o</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">音楽 <span class="furigana">おんがく</span></b><br><span class="rom">ongaku</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>音乐</span><span data-en>music</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">わたしは、おんがくをきくのがすきです。</div><div class="rom">Watashi wa, ongaku o kiku no ga suki desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>我喜欢听音乐。</span><span data-en>I like listening to music.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">か</span><span class="kana-kat">カ</span><span class="rom">ka</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">風 <span class="furigana">かぜ</span></b><br><span class="rom">kaze</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>风</span><span data-en>wind</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">きょうは、かぜがつよいです。</div><div class="rom">Kyō wa, kaze ga tsuyoi desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>今天风很大。</span><span data-en>The wind is strong today.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">き</span><span class="kana-kat">キ</span><span class="rom">ki</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">木 <span class="furigana">き</span></b><br><span class="rom">ki</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>树</span><span data-en>tree</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">このきは、とてもふるいです。</div><div class="rom">Kono ki wa, totemo furui desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>这棵树很老了。</span><span data-en>This tree is very old.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">く</span><span class="kana-kat">ク</span><span class="rom">ku</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">雲 <span class="furigana">くも</span></b><br><span class="rom">kumo</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>云</span><span data-en>cloud</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">そらに、くもがうかんでいます。</div><div class="rom">Sora ni, kumo ga ukande imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>天上飘着云。</span><span data-en>Clouds float in the sky.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">け</span><span class="kana-kat">ケ</span><span class="rom">ke</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">景色 <span class="furigana">けしき</span></b><br><span class="rom">keshiki</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>景色</span><span data-en>scenery</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">ふじさんのけしきは、すばらしいです。</div><div class="rom">Fujisan no keshiki wa, subarashii desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>富士山的景色很美。</span><span data-en>Mt. Fuji's scenery is wonderful.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">こ</span><span class="kana-kat">コ</span><span class="rom">ko</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">心 <span class="furigana">こころ</span></b><br><span class="rom">kokoro</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>心</span><span data-en>heart</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">こころをこめて、てがみをかきました。</div><div class="rom">Kokoro o komete, tegami o kakimashita.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>我用心写了这封信。</span><span data-en>I wrote the letter with all my heart.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">さ</span><span class="kana-kat">サ</span><span class="rom">sa</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">桜 <span class="furigana">さくら</span></b><br><span class="rom">sakura</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>樱花</span><span data-en>cherry blossom</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">さくらが、はらはらとちります。</div><div class="rom">Sakura ga, harahara to chirimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>樱花簌簌飘落。</span><span data-en>Cherry blossoms flutter down.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">し</span><span class="kana-kat">シ</span><span class="rom">shi</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">幸せ <span class="furigana">しあわせ</span></b><br><span class="rom">shiawase</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>幸福</span><span data-en>happiness</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">いちばんのしあわせは、かぞくとすごすじかんです。</div><div class="rom">Ichiban no shiawase wa, kazoku to sugosu jikan desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>最大的幸福，是和家人在一起的时光。</span><span data-en>My greatest happiness is time with my family.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">す</span><span class="kana-kat">ス</span><span class="rom">su</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">雀 <span class="furigana">すずめ</span></b><br><span class="rom">suzume</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>麻雀</span><span data-en>sparrow</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">すずめたちが、ちゅんちゅんとないています。</div><div class="rom">Suzume-tachi ga, chunchun to naite imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>麻雀们啾啾地叫着。</span><span data-en>The sparrows are chirping.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">せ</span><span class="kana-kat">セ</span><span class="rom">se</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">世界 <span class="furigana">せかい</span></b><br><span class="rom">sekai</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>世界</span><span data-en>world</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">せかいは、ひろくて、ふしぎがいっぱいです。</div><div class="rom">Sekai wa, hirokute, fushigi ga ippai desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>世界辽阔，充满神奇。</span><span data-en>The world is wide and full of wonders.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">そ</span><span class="kana-kat">ソ</span><span class="rom">so</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">空 <span class="furigana">そら</span></b><br><span class="rom">sora</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>天空</span><span data-en>sky</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">きょうのそらは、とってもあおいです。</div><div class="rom">Kyō no sora wa, tottemo aoi desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>今天的天空非常蓝。</span><span data-en>Today's sky is so blue.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">た</span><span class="kana-kat">タ</span><span class="rom">ta</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">太陽 <span class="furigana">たいよう</span></b><br><span class="rom">taiyō</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>太阳</span><span data-en>sun</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">あさになると、たいようがのぼります。</div><div class="rom">Asa ni naru to, taiyō ga noborimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>一到早晨，太阳就升起。</span><span data-en>When morning comes, the sun rises.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ち</span><span class="kana-kat">チ</span><span class="rom">chi</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">力 <span class="furigana">ちから</span></b><br><span class="rom">chikara</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>力量</span><span data-en>strength</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">みんなで、ちからをあわせましょう。</div><div class="rom">Minna de, chikara o awasemashō.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>大家齐心协力吧。</span><span data-en>Let's join our strength.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">つ</span><span class="kana-kat">ツ</span><span class="rom">tsu</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">月 <span class="furigana">つき</span></b><br><span class="rom">tsuki</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>月亮</span><span data-en>moon</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">つきが、にわをしろくてらしています。</div><div class="rom">Tsuki ga, niwa o shiroku terashite imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>月光把院子照得雪白。</span><span data-en>The moon lights the garden white.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">て</span><span class="kana-kat">テ</span><span class="rom">te</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">手 <span class="furigana">て</span></b><br><span class="rom">te</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>手</span><span data-en>hand</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">てをあらってから、ごはんをたべます。</div><div class="rom">Te o aratte kara, gohan o tabemasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>先洗手，再吃饭。</span><span data-en>I wash my hands, then eat.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">と</span><span class="kana-kat">ト</span><span class="rom">to</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">鳥 <span class="furigana">とり</span></b><br><span class="rom">tori</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>鸟</span><span data-en>bird</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">あさはやくから、とりがなきはじめます。</div><div class="rom">Asa hayaku kara, tori ga naki-hajimemasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>清晨，鸟儿就开始啼鸣。</span><span data-en>From early morning, the birds start singing.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">な</span><span class="kana-kat">ナ</span><span class="rom">na</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">夏 <span class="furigana">なつ</span></b><br><span class="rom">natsu</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>夏天</span><span data-en>summer</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">にほんのなつは、むしあついです。</div><div class="rom">Nihon no natsu wa, mushiatsui desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>日本的夏天闷热。</span><span data-en>Japan's summers are hot and humid.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">に</span><span class="kana-kat">ニ</span><span class="rom">ni</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">日本 <span class="furigana">にほん</span></b><br><span class="rom">Nihon</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>日本</span><span data-en>Japan</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">にほんには、よっつのきせつがあります。</div><div class="rom">Nihon ni wa, yottsu no kisetsu ga arimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>日本有四个季节。</span><span data-en>Japan has four seasons.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ぬ</span><span class="kana-kat">ヌ</span><span class="rom">nu</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">沼 <span class="furigana">ぬま</span></b><br><span class="rom">numa</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>沼泽</span><span data-en>marsh</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">むかし、このあたりは、ぬまでした。</div><div class="rom">Mukashi, kono atari wa, numa deshita.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>从前，这一带是一片沼泽。</span><span data-en>Long ago, this area was marshland.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ね</span><span class="kana-kat">ネ</span><span class="rom">ne</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">猫 <span class="furigana">ねこ</span></b><br><span class="rom">neko</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>猫</span><span data-en>cat</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">うちのねこは、ひるねをするのがすきです。</div><div class="rom">Uchi no neko wa, hirune o suru no ga suki desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>我家的猫喜欢午睡。</span><span data-en>Our cat likes to nap.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">の</span><span class="kana-kat">ノ</span><span class="rom">no</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">野 <span class="furigana">の</span></b><br><span class="rom">no</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>原野</span><span data-en>field</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">のはらに、ちょうちょがとんでいます。</div><div class="rom">Nohara ni, chōcho ga tonde imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>蝴蝶在原野上飞舞。</span><span data-en>Butterflies fly over the field.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">は</span><span class="kana-kat">ハ</span><span class="rom">ha</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">花 <span class="furigana">はな</span></b><br><span class="rom">hana</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>花</span><span data-en>flower</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">にわに、はながたくさんさきました。</div><div class="rom">Niwa ni, hana ga takusan sakimashita.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>院子里开了很多花。</span><span data-en>Many flowers have bloomed in the garden.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ひ</span><span class="kana-kat">ヒ</span><span class="rom">hi</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">人 <span class="furigana">ひと</span></b><br><span class="rom">hito</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>人</span><span data-en>person</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">あのかたは、わたしのせんせいです。</div><div class="rom">Ano kata wa, watashi no sensei desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>那位是我的老师。</span><span data-en>That person is my teacher.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ふ</span><span class="kana-kat">フ</span><span class="rom">fu</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">冬 <span class="furigana">ふゆ</span></b><br><span class="rom">fuyu</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>冬天</span><span data-en>winter</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">ふゆになると、ゆきがふります。</div><div class="rom">Fuyu ni naru to, yuki ga furimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>一到冬天就下雪。</span><span data-en>When winter comes, it snows.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">へ</span><span class="kana-kat">ヘ</span><span class="rom">he</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">平和 <span class="furigana">へいわ</span></b><br><span class="rom">heiwa</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>和平</span><span data-en>peace</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">みんなで、へいわをねがっています。</div><div class="rom">Minna de, heiwa o negatte imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>大家都在祈愿和平。</span><span data-en>Everyone wishes for peace.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ほ</span><span class="kana-kat">ホ</span><span class="rom">ho</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">星 <span class="furigana">ほし</span></b><br><span class="rom">hoshi</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>星星</span><span data-en>star</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">よるのそらに、ほしがかがやきます。</div><div class="rom">Yoru no sora ni, hoshi ga kagayakimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>星星在夜空中闪耀。</span><span data-en>Stars shine in the night sky.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ま</span><span class="kana-kat">マ</span><span class="rom">ma</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">松 <span class="furigana">まつ</span></b><br><span class="rom">matsu</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>松树</span><span data-en>pine</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">まつのきは、ふゆでも、みどりです。</div><div class="rom">Matsu no ki wa, fuyu demo, midori desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>松树即使冬天也是绿的。</span><span data-en>Pine trees stay green even in winter.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">み</span><span class="kana-kat">ミ</span><span class="rom">mi</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">水 <span class="furigana">みず</span></b><br><span class="rom">mizu</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>水</span><span data-en>water</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">このみずは、とてもきれいです。</div><div class="rom">Kono mizu wa, totemo kirei desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>这水很清。</span><span data-en>This water is very clear.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">む</span><span class="kana-kat">ム</span><span class="rom">mu</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">虫 <span class="furigana">むし</span></b><br><span class="rom">mushi</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>虫</span><span data-en>insect</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">なつには、むしのこえがきこえます。</div><div class="rom">Natsu ni wa, mushi no koe ga kikoemasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>夏天能听见虫鸣。</span><span data-en>In summer, you hear the voices of insects.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">め</span><span class="kana-kat">メ</span><span class="rom">me</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">目 <span class="furigana">め</span></b><br><span class="rom">me</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>眼睛</span><span data-en>eye</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">めをとじて、ゆっくりいきをしましょう。</div><div class="rom">Me o tojite, yukkuri iki o shimashō.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>闭上眼睛，慢慢呼吸。</span><span data-en>Close your eyes and breathe slowly.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">も</span><span class="kana-kat">モ</span><span class="rom">mo</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">森 <span class="furigana">もり</span></b><br><span class="rom">mori</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>森林</span><span data-en>forest</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">もりには、いろなどうぶつがすんでいます。</div><div class="rom">Mori ni wa, iro na dōbutsu ga sunde imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>森林里住着各种动物。</span><span data-en>Many animals live in the forest.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">や</span><span class="kana-kat">ヤ</span><span class="rom">ya</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">山 <span class="furigana">やま</span></b><br><span class="rom">yama</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>山</span><span data-en>mountain</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">やまのいただきには、ゆきがあります。</div><div class="rom">Yama no itadaki ni wa, yuki ga arimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>山顶上有积雪。</span><span data-en>There is snow on the mountaintop.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ゆ</span><span class="kana-kat">ユ</span><span class="rom">yu</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">雪 <span class="furigana">ゆき</span></b><br><span class="rom">yuki</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>雪</span><span data-en>snow</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">ゆきが、しんしんとふっています。</div><div class="rom">Yuki ga, shinshin to futte imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>雪正静静地飘落。</span><span data-en>Snow falls silently.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">よ</span><span class="kana-kat">ヨ</span><span class="rom">yo</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">夜 <span class="furigana">よる</span></b><br><span class="rom">yoru</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>夜晚</span><span data-en>night</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">よるになると、つきがきれいです。</div><div class="rom">Yoru ni naru to, tsuki ga kirei desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>到了夜晚，月亮很美。</span><span data-en>At night, the moon is beautiful.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ら</span><span class="kana-kat">ラ</span><span class="rom">ra</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">来年 <span class="furigana">らいねん</span></b><br><span class="rom">rainen</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>明年</span><span data-en>next year</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">らいねん、にほんをたずねます。</div><div class="rom">Rainen, Nihon o tazunemasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>明年，我造访日本。</span><span data-en>Next year, I will visit Japan.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">り</span><span class="kana-kat">リ</span><span class="rom">ri</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">林檎 <span class="furigana">りんご</span></b><br><span class="rom">ringo</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>苹果</span><span data-en>apple</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">りんごを、ひとつください。</div><div class="rom">Ringo o, hitotsu kudasai.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>请给我一个苹果。</span><span data-en>One apple, please.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">る</span><span class="kana-kat">ル</span><span class="rom">ru</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">留守 <span class="furigana">るす</span></b><br><span class="rom">rusu</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>不在家</span><span data-en>away from home</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">いま、かぞくはみんな、るすです。</div><div class="rom">Ima, kazoku wa minna, rusu desu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>现在家人都不在家。</span><span data-en>Everyone is out right now.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">れ</span><span class="kana-kat">レ</span><span class="rom">re</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">歴史 <span class="furigana">れきし</span></b><br><span class="rom">rekishi</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>历史</span><span data-en>history</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">いま、にほんのれきしをべんきょうしています。</div><div class="rom">Ima, Nihon no rekishi o benkyō shite imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>我正在学日本历史。</span><span data-en>I am studying Japanese history.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ろ</span><span class="kana-kat">ロ</span><span class="rom">ro</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">蝋燭 <span class="furigana">ろうそく</span></b><br><span class="rom">rōsoku</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>蜡烛</span><span data-en>candle</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">とうろうに、ろうそくをともしました。</div><div class="rom">Tōrō ni, rōsoku o tomoshimashita.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>我在灯笼里点上了蜡烛。</span><span data-en>I lit a candle in the lantern.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">わ</span><span class="kana-kat">ワ</span><span class="rom">wa</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">和 <span class="furigana">わ</span></b><br><span class="rom">wa</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>和谐</span><span data-en>harmony</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">わを、たいせつにしています。</div><div class="rom">Wa o, taisetsu ni shite imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>珍惜「和」。</span><span data-en>We treasure harmony.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">を</span><span class="kana-kat">ヲ</span><span class="rom">o</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">格助詞 <span class="furigana">を</span></b><br><span class="rom">wo / o</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>宾格助词</span><span data-en>object particle</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">ほんをよみます。</div><div class="rom">Hon o yomimasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>读书。</span><span data-en>I read a book.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="kc"><span class="big">ん</span><span class="kana-kat">ン</span><span class="rom">n</span></td>
          <td><b class="kw2">撥音 <span class="furigana">はつおん</span></b><br><span class="rom">hatsuon</span></td>
          <td><span data-zh>音节鼻音</span><span data-en>syllabic nasal</span></td>
          <td><div class="sent">しんぶんを、よんでいます。</div><div class="rom">Shinbun o, yonde imasu.</div><div class="tr"><span data-zh>正在读报。</span><span data-en>I'm reading the newspaper.</span></div></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="teach-note">
    <span data-zh><strong>织法说明：</strong>つき（月）・みず（水）・こころ（心）・わ（和）已入核心术语表，一片海域照进八种语法之镜；46 词皆可各长成一张 C 型词卡。例句为教学自造句（AI 起草・待母语者审校），记 → 读 → 写三步学习之后，入正式语料前须走审校。</span>
    <span data-en><strong>Woven notes:</strong> つき (moon) · みず (water) · こころ (heart) · わ (harmony) are already in the core glossary — one sea, eight mirrors of grammar. Each of the 46 words can grow into a C-type word-card. The example sentences are AI-drafted teaching lines awaiting native review before they enter the formal corpus.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ THEMES ═══ -->
<section class="section band-paper" id="themes">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>主题矩阵</span><span data-en>Theme Matrix</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>五大主题 · 五大「织语」子系列，每个主题先定约 12 个心象，逐期灌溉成片</span><span data-en>Five themes, five sub-series; each theme begins with ~12 "images of thought"</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="theme-grid">
    <div class="theme-card">
      <span class="mark">山</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>织语 · 自然</span><span data-en>Nature</span></h4>
      <span class="en-name">Nature in Every Tongue</span>
      <p><span data-zh>春 · 月 · 海 · 山 · 树 · 雪 · 光 · 星空 · 风 · 溪 · 节气 · 雨</span><span data-en>spring · moon · sea · mountain · tree · snow · light · stars · wind · stream · seasons · rain</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="theme-card">
      <span class="mark">觉</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>织语 · 觉</span><span data-en>Awakening</span></h4>
      <span class="en-name">Awakened Words</span>
      <p><span data-zh>无常 · 当下 · 生死 · 觉知 · 放下 · 自由 · 静 · 初心 · 精进 · 回归</span><span data-en>impermanence · now · life &amp; death · awareness · letting go · freedom · stillness · beginner's mind · diligence · return</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="theme-card">
      <span class="mark">文</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>织语 · 文明</span><span data-en>Civilization</span></h4>
      <span class="en-name">Civilizations Whisper</span>
      <p><span data-zh>语言起源 · 文字源流 · 经典 · 神话对坐 · 哲学 · 桥梁</span><span data-en>origins of language · scripts · classics · myths side by side · philosophy · bridges</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="theme-card">
      <span class="mark">心</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>织语 · 渐悟</span><span data-en>Insights</span></h4>
      <span class="en-name">Notes on Living</span>
      <p><span data-zh>时间 · 幸福 · 友谊 · 知足 · 热爱 · 孤独 · 勇气 · 简单</span><span data-en>time · happiness · friendship · contentment · passion · solitude · courage · simplicity</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="theme-card">
      <span class="mark">茶</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>织语 · 日常</span><span data-en>Daily</span></h4>
      <span class="en-name">Everyday Songs</span>
      <p><span data-zh>清晨 · 茶 · 散步 · 家常 · 相逢 · 劳作 · 一餐 · 睡眠 · 旅途</span><span data-en>morning · tea · a walk · home · reunion · labor · a meal · sleep · the road</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="teach-note">
    <strong data-both><span data-zh>选题三问（每期必答）</span><span data-en>Selection Triad (every episode)</span></strong>
    <span data-zh>：① 这个心象是否「一句即见全豹」？② 八语对它是否「各有其说」且「殊途同归」？③ 能否带一条织线（词源 / 语法 / 文化互文）？——三期全过才入池。</span>
    <span data-en> &nbsp;One sentence must hold the whole image; the eight tongues must each speak it their own way and still converge; it must carry a weaving thread (etymology, grammar, or cultural intertext). Pass all three, and it enters the backlog.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FORMATS ═══ -->
<section class="section band-dark" id="formats">
  <div class="section-header dark">
    <h2><span data-zh>六种格式</span><span data-en>Six Templates</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle" data-both>
      <span data-zh>当前阶段以文字为主 —— 网页、词卡与平行语料先行；视频统一 16:9 宽屏、为 YouTube 嵌入预留，制作方案另列规划。</span>
      <span data-en>Text-first for now: web, word-cards and the corpus lead. Video will be 16:9 widescreen, sized for YouTube embedding — its plan is settled separately.</span>
    </div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="fmt-grid">
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">A</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>一镜八澜 · 叠式短视频</span><span data-en>Stack Short</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">30–60s · widescreen 16:9 · YouTube</span>
      <p><span data-zh>一帧留白起钩子 → 逐语登场（每语 4–6s，语音先、字幕随）→ 八语同屏合璧、织线注疏浮出。</span><span data-en>A held frame hooks in — each language steps in (4–6s, voice first) — the eight stack into one screen and a weaving note surfaces.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">B</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>对读之辩 · 织式长视频</span><span data-en>Weave Long</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">3–6min · landscape 16:9</span>
      <p><span data-zh>原文深读 + 逐语对读 + 「不可译实验室」——3 句话讲透为什么侘寂、lagom 翻不进去。</span><span data-en>Deep reading + per-language reading + the Untranslatable Lab: three sentences on why wabi-sabi or lagom can't be carried over.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">C</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>一词万境 · 每日一词</span><span data-en>Word of the Day</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">card 9:16 · 15–30s audio</span>
      <p><span data-zh>一字原形 → IPA → 拉丁转写 → 直译+注释 → 出处 → 一致影像 → 八语对照小行。</span><span data-en>Big glyph → IPA → transliteration → gloss + note → source → a shared image → an eight-language echo line.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">D</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>同题异想 · 多语对读</span><span data-en>Parallel Reading</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">learning format</span>
      <p><span data-zh>逐行八语并列、一行一朗读，句读给呼吸，呼吸给理解——适合《道德经》一课 × 八语。</span><span data-en>One poem or passage, eight rows, one voiced line each; the pause between lines is the understanding.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">E</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>语之谱系 · 词源解密</span><span data-en>Etymology</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">1–2min · word-genealogy tree</span>
      <p><span data-zh>一个词的八语分身 → 追根（印欧原根 / 汉字源流）→ 落地看各自文明——「同源而殊途，殊途而同归」。</span><span data-en>One word, eight incarnations, traced to a root and landed in each civilization: same source, separate roads, one return.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-card">
      <span class="code">F</span>
      <h4><span data-zh>七语八澜 · 轮诵合唱</span><span data-en>Choir</span></h4>
      <span class="en-tag">60–90s · festivals</span>
      <p><span data-zh>同一文本逐语轮诵，最后八语交叉淡化合一收束；节奏按诗律而非等分。</span><span data-en>One text chanted around the circle, then eight voices cross-fade into one; rhythm follows the poetry, not the metronome.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pillar-hint">
    <span data-zh>…每条固定元素与分镜明细，见 </span>
    <span data-en>…full beat sheets live in the </span>
    <a href="../../Language%20Stacking-Linguistic%20Weaving/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-zh>总体规划 README §7</span><span data-en>Master Plan README §7</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ SAMPLE STACK ═══ -->
<section class="section band-paper" id="sample">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>样例 · 一镜八澜</span><span data-en>Worked Sample</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>「海上生明月，天涯共此时」——张九龄《望月怀远》（唐）· 演示叠 + 织 + 照</span><span data-en>Zhang Jiuling, "Wang Yue Huai Yuan" (Tang) — a demonstration of Stack + Weave + Illuminate</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="stack-wrap">
    <table class="stack-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th><span data-zh>语</span><span data-en>Lang</span></th>
          <th><span data-zh>译文 Rendering</span><span data-en>Rendering</span></th>
          <th><span data-zh>字面直译 / 注 Literal / Note</span><span data-en>Literal / Note</span></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">中文</td>
          <td class="si18n">海上生明月，天涯共此时。</td>
          <td class="gloss"><span data-en>Source</span><span data-zh>原句</span> · 张九龄《望月怀远》· 唐 <span data-zh>「生」=月从海中生出</span><span data-en>"生": the moon is born from the sea</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">English</td>
          <td class="si18n">Over the sea a bright moon rises;<br>we share this moment across the world.</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. on-sea it-begets bright-moon; sky's-edge together this-hour — "生" = to give birth to</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">Français</td>
          <td class="si18n">Au-dessus de la mer, une lune claire se lève ;<br>nous partageons cet instant aux confins du monde.</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. above-of-the sea, a moon clear itself-raises; we share this instant at the limits of-the world</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">日本語</td>
          <td class="si18n gja">海の上に明月昇り、天涯にこの時を同じくす。</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. 海·<span data-en>gen.</span><span data-zh>属格</span>·上に bright-moon rises；天涯=世界の果て、時を同じく=同刻</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">संस्कृतम्</td>
          <td class="si18n gsa"><span data-zh>待专家起草</span><span data-en>pending specialist draft</span></td>
          <td class="gloss">词汇层：समुद्र samudra（海）· चन्द्र candra（月）· समां घटिकां samāṃ ghaṭikāṃ（共此时）——整句译由受训译员完成并审校</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">Latina</td>
          <td class="si18n">Clara luna super mare oritur;<br>nos hoc idem momentum per totum orbem tenemus.</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. clear moon above the sea rises; we this same moment through the whole world hold — mare/mar/sea 词族直达印欧</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">Deutsch</td>
          <td class="si18n">Über dem Meer erhebt sich der lichte Mond;<br>wir teilen diese Stunde bis ans Ende der Welt.</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. over the sea rises the bright moon; we share this hour to the end of the world</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="l">Svenska</td>
          <td class="si18n">Över havet stiger den klara månen;<br>vi delar denna stund vid världens ände.</td>
          <td class="gloss">lit. over the sea rises the clear moon; we share this hour at the world's end — hav/sea · måne/moon · stund/moment</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="teach-note">
    <strong data-both><span data-zh>教学注 · 这颗月亮的「语法性别」</span><span data-en>Teaching note · the moon's grammatical gender</span></strong>
    <span data-zh>：la lune（法·阴）、der Mond（德·阳）、the moon（英·无）、月（中·无）、candra（梵·阳）——语言孕育了我们看待世界的方式。正式成片前，所有译文须经 §10 审校。</span>
    <span data-en> &nbsp;la lune (Fr·feminine), der Mond (De·masculine), the moon (En·none), 月 (Zh·none), candra (Sa·masculine) — grammar shapes how we see the world. All renderings must pass §10 review before release.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ GLOSSARY ═══ -->
<section class="section band-soft" id="glossary">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>核心术语表</span><span data-en>Core Glossary</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>水 · 月 · 心 —— 十二个心象词 × 八语，全期一致性的底表</span><span data-en>Twelve image-words × eight tongues — the consistency floor for every episode</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="gloss-wrap">
    <table class="gloss-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th><span data-zh>概念</span><span data-en>Concept</span></th>
          <th>zh</th><th>en</th><th>fr</th><th>ja</th><th>sa</th><th>la</th><th>de</th><th>sv</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>水 · Water</span><span data-en>Water</span></td><td>水</td><td>water</td><td>eau</td><td class="gja">水（みず）</td><td class="gsa">jala जल</td><td>aqua</td><td>Wasser</td><td>vatten</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>月 · Moon</span><span data-en>Moon</span></td><td>月</td><td>moon</td><td>lune</td><td class="gja">月（つき）</td><td class="gsa">candra चन्द्र</td><td>luna</td><td>Mond</td><td>måne</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>心 · Heart</span><span data-en>Heart</span></td><td>心</td><td>heart</td><td>cœur</td><td class="gja">心（こころ）</td><td class="gsa">hṛdaya हृदय</td><td>cor</td><td>Herz</td><td>hjärta</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>时间 · Time</span><span data-en>Time</span></td><td>时</td><td>time</td><td>temps</td><td class="gja">時（とき）</td><td class="gsa">kāla काल</td><td>tempus</td><td>Zeit</td><td>tid</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>海 · Sea</span><span data-en>Sea</span></td><td>海</td><td>sea</td><td>mer</td><td class="gja">海（うみ）</td><td class="gsa">samudra समुद्र</td><td>mare</td><td>Meer</td><td>hav</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>自由 · Freedom</span><span data-en>Freedom</span></td><td>自由</td><td>freedom</td><td>liberté</td><td class="gja">自由（じゆう）</td><td class="gsa">mokṣa / स्वतन्त्र</td><td>libertas</td><td>Freiheit</td><td>frihet</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>茶 · Tea</span><span data-en>Tea</span></td><td>茶</td><td>tea</td><td>thé</td><td class="gja">茶（ちゃ）</td><td class="gsa">cāya चाय</td><td>(theria 借)</td><td>Tee</td><td>te</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>寂静 · Silence</span><span data-en>Silence</span></td><td>静</td><td>silence</td><td>silence</td><td class="gja">静けさ（しずけさ）</td><td class="gsa">śāntiḥ शान्तिः</td><td>silentium</td><td>Stille</td><td>tystnad</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>树 · Tree</span><span data-en>Tree</span></td><td>树</td><td>tree</td><td>arbre</td><td class="gja">木（こ）</td><td class="gsa">vṛkṣa वृक्ष</td><td>arbor</td><td>Baum</td><td>träd</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>风 · Wind</span><span data-en>Wind</span></td><td>风</td><td>wind</td><td>vent</td><td class="gja">風（かぜ）</td><td class="gsa">vāta वात</td><td>ventus</td><td>Wind</td><td>vind</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>光 · Light</span><span data-en>Light</span></td><td>光</td><td>light</td><td>lumière</td><td class="gja">光（ひかり）</td><td class="gsa">jyoti ज्योति</td><td>lux</td><td>Licht</td><td>ljus</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="concept"><span data-zh>自然 · Nature</span><span data-en>Nature</span></td><td>自然</td><td>nature</td><td>nature</td><td class="gja">自然（しぜん）</td><td class="gsa">prakṛti प्रकृति</td><td>natura</td><td>Natur</td><td>natur</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="teach-note">
    <span data-both>
      <span data-zh>词汇本身即是故事：<em>prakṛti</em>（自然/本性与「造」同根）、<em>Zeit</em> 与 <em>tid</em> 同属印欧 *dī-（分开）……每一行都可能长出一条 E 型词源片。完整底表见 <code>02_corpus/glossary.md</code>。</span>
      <span data-en>Each word is already a story: prakṛti shares a root with "make"; Zeit and tid both descend from PIE *dī- (to divide)… every row is a potential etymology episode.</span>
    </span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ ROADMAP ═══ -->
<section class="section band-paper" id="roadmap">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2><span data-zh>路线图</span><span data-en>Roadmap</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>先跑通全链，再谈放量——从一艘船到一张帆</span><span data-en>Prove the whole chain before scaling — one boat first, then a sail</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="road">
    <div class="road-item"><span class="dot">P0</span><div><h4><span data-zh>地基</span><span data-en>Foundation</span> <span class="when">· 第 1–2 周</span></h4><p><span data-zh>设计包 + 语料 schema + 工具脚本：8 张身份卡 · 5 张主题卡 · JSON schema · TTS 与素材验证。</span><span data-en>Design kit, corpus schema, and tools: 8 identity cards, 5 theme cards, JSON schema, TTS &amp; footage validation.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="road-item"><span class="dot">P1</span><div><h4><span data-zh>试片</span><span data-en>Pilots</span> <span class="when">· 第 3–6 周</span></h4><p><span data-zh>5 条宽屏（16:9）试片跑通全链：A 型×3 + C 型×1 + E 型×1（首批清单见下）。</span><span data-en>Five widescreen (16:9) pilots through the whole pipeline: A×3, C×1, E×1 (list below).</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="road-item"><span class="dot">P2</span><div><h4><span data-zh>全 8 语链路</span><span data-en>All-8-Chain</span> <span class="when">· 第 1–2 月</span></h4><p><span data-zh>sa / la 的语音策略落地（学者→Indic TTS→兜底），首条 B 型长视频 + 例行周更。</span><span data-en>Voice strategy for Sanskrit and Latin lands; first B-type long video and the weekly rhythm begins.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="road-item"><span class="dot">P3</span><div><h4><span data-zh>系列化</span><span data-en>Series</span> <span class="when">· 季度</span></h4><p><span data-zh>5 主题 × 8 条 = 40 条主线 + 一词万境 100+；主题合集播放列表 + GitHub Pages 剧场。</span><span data-en>Five themes × eight episodes = 40 mains plus 100+ word cards; collection playlists and the Pages theatre.</span></p></div></div>
    <div class="road-item"><span class="dot">P4</span><div><h4><span data-zh>交互</span><span data-en>Interactivity</span> <span class="when">· 半年+</span></h4><p><span data-zh>叠字阅读器 + 跟读模式；学习模式与共同翻译社区。</span><span data-en>The stacked-glyph reader and read-after-me mode; a learning mode and a community translation space.</span></p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ PILOTS ═══ -->
<section class="section band-dark" id="pilots">
  <div class="section-header dark">
    <h2><span data-zh>首批试片</span><span data-en>First Pilots</span></h2>
    <div class="subtitle"><span data-zh>P1 五条：先出 5 条试片跑通全链，再放量</span><span data-en>Five pilots prove the chain before anything scales</span></div>
    <span class="divider"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="pilot-grid">
    <div class="pilot-card">
      <span class="typ">A 叠式</span>
      <h5><span data-zh>《一镜八澜 · 月》</span><span data-en>One Mirror, Eight Ripples · Moon</span></h5>
      <p><span data-zh>张九龄「海上生明月，天涯共此时」</span><span data-en>Zhang Jiuling's moon over the sea</span></p>
      <div class="why">— <span data-zh>全 8 语齐发力 · 人心所向</span><span data-en>all eight tongues fire at once</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pilot-card">
      <span class="typ">A 叠式</span>
      <h5><span data-zh>《海之名词学》</span><span data-en>The Taxonomy of the Sea</span></h5>
      <p><span data-zh>一「海」水之一体，八语之名（印欧词族 + 汉字）</span><span data-en>one sea, eight names: the Indo-European web meets Hanzi</span></p>
      <div class="why">— <span data-zh>E 型词源前置，双格式复用</span><span data-en>front-loads the etymology format</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pilot-card">
      <span class="typ">C 词卡</span>
      <h5><span data-zh>一词万境 #1 · lagom</span><span data-en>Word of the Day #1 · lagom</span></h5>
      <p><span data-zh>瑞典语「适度」——不多不少，恰如其分</span><span data-en>Swedish "just right, not too much"</span></p>
      <div class="why">— <span data-zh>预热瑞典语 + 不可译话题</span><span data-en>preheats Swedish and the untranslatable</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pilot-card">
      <span class="typ">F 轮诵</span>
      <h5><span data-zh>《七语八澜 · 冬》</span><span data-en>Seven Tongues, Eight Ripples · Winter</span></h5>
      <p><span data-zh>冬之微诗 / 寒夜短句（自制原文，免责安全）</span><span data-en>original winter micro-poems — rights-safe by design</span></p>
      <div class="why">— <span data-zh>时节即流量</span><span data-en>seasonality is traffic</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pilot-card">
      <span class="typ">E 词源</span>
      <h5><span data-zh>《语之谱系 · 心》</span><span data-en>The Lineage of a Word · Heart</span></h5>
      <p><span data-zh>heart / cœur / cor / Herz / hjärta / हृदय / 心 —— 同源与殊途</span><span data-en>one root, seven heirs, same source, separate roads</span></p>
      <div class="why">— <span data-zh>教育感最强 · 收藏率高</span><span data-en>the most teachable, the most saved</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pillar-hint">
